STG JARVIS Dashboard Revision and Missing-Data Requirements
Initial developer handoff for Joshua | Prepared July 24, 2026
Dashboard reviewed: Skip The Groomer JARVIS Live Morning Dashboard
Purpose: Turn the dashboard into a reliable daily operating system that tells Will what happened, where it happened, whether the data is current, and what needs action. This document combines the requested layout changes, missing-data fixes, attribution requirements, advertising metrics, subscription reporting, inventory ordering, and acceptance criteria.
P0 issue: The public dashboard currently reports that it cannot load data/connectors_data.json. Data loading and schema validation must be fixed before visual refinements are considered complete. A page may not display GREEN while critical cards show “No data,” “null%,” or missing sections.
